  "details": "Near-Clip Plane Adjustment tends to cause things to misbehave when a world has this set too low. Like:\n- Menus misbehaving/Mouse precision\n- Worlds far clip plane drastically reduced\n- Odd graphical glitching in worlds\nWorlds that have it set to 0.01m seems to have the desired result with hardly any issues except for the rare few.\nAlternatively, if it's desired to keep 0.001m, there can possibly be a setting anywhere to change your desired minimum near-clip plane, or a simple toggle to switch it between 0.01m and 0.001m.",
